{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02548","headline":"奉和喜雪应制 · 许敬宗","name":"奉和喜雪应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嵰州表奇贶，閟竹应遐巡。\n何如御京洛，流霰下天津。\n忽若琼林曙，俄同李径春。\n姑峯映仙质，郢路杂歌尘。\n伏槛观花瑞，称觞庆冬积。\n飘河共泻银，委树还重璧。\n连山分掩翠，绵霄远韬碧。\n千里徧浮空，五轫咸沦迹。\n机前辉裂素，池上伴凌波。\n腾华承玉宇，凝照混金娥。\n是日松筠性，欣奉柏梁歌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02548.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02548","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}